    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It should not be used directly. See the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_slot_index" kindref="compound">SlotIndex</ref> &amp; <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_slot_indexes" kindref="compound">SlotIndexes</ref> classes for the public interface to this information. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
